POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "jccCode",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/problem/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "两数之和",
  "description": "输入两个整数 a 和 b，输出它们的和。\n输入格式：一行两个整数，以空格分隔。\n输出格式：输出一个整数，表示 a+b。\n数据范围：-1000000000 ≤ a,b ≤ 1000000000。",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "samples": [
    {
      "input": "1 2\n",
      "output": "3\n"
    }
  ],
  "judgeCases": [
    {
      "input": "10 20\n",
      "output": "30\n"
    },
    {
      "input": "-1 1\n",
      "output": "0\n"
    },
    {
      "input": "-5 -7\n",
      "output": "-12\n"
    },
    {
      "input": "1000000000 1000000000\n",
      "output": "2000000000\n"
    }
  ],
  "judgeConfig": {
    "timeLimit": 1000,
    "memoryLimit": 256,
    "stackLimit": 64
  },
  "solution": null
}

### 发布题目（将 1 换成创建接口返回的 data）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/problem/1/publish

### 查询公开题目
GET http://localhost:8080/problem

### 查询题目详情
GET http://localhost:8080/problem/1
